          <stringProp name="HTTPSampler.embedded_url_re"></stringProp>
          <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Anonymize + soft-delete a contact: personal attributes are cleared, the record itself is kept for GoBD retention (Art. 17(3)(e) DSGVO). The audit trigger on &#x60;contacts&#x60; already records who/when. </stringProp>
        </HTTPSamplerProxy>
